  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Development of Exemptions Regulations in Support of Ghana&#x2019;s Exemptions Act 2022(1083)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Exemptions Act, 2022 (Act 1083) was passed by the Parliament of Ghana in September 2022 and it is to regulate the application of tax exemptions and other exemptions and to provide for related matters. The objective of the assignment is to procure the services of an Expert to assist the Tax Policy Unit in the development of Regulations to support the Exemptions Act 2022 (Act 1083</narrative>
  </description>
